comments.body:
@lomky you are definitely right that we want to know whether someone had an alt contact or not, and that we don't want to know the PII of that person. Relationship is a little borderline and I think I'd rather err on the side of not saving it. 

re: persisting other contact info, in #1004 we're rolling out a `has_other_contact?` convenience method. Maybe we can have that as a persisted boolean field, and have it as part of a `after_save` hook.

Love the idea of an 'archive' field blacklist to deal with nuking sensitive fields.

I think @lomky 's thinking about scramble timelines here is right on. I'd say give fulfillment cases a 30 day grace period.

There's some DCAF standard operating procedure for returning a fulfillment to us - we ask for return within 60 days. I think doubling that is right on. 

@lomky anything for unsticking here?
